WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.870
At the heart of the Blight, the last roar
faded.

2
00:00:05.158 --> 00:00:07.918
And everything it had taken flew free.

3
00:00:09.658 --> 00:00:14.998
The Eight Wyrms rose into a new morning,
each one singing its own song again.

4
00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:21.449
In the night garden, an old man without a
crown planted his pale rose,

5
00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.607
and let it be an ordinary rose.

6
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:27.577
The Rootgate glowed gold, and the heroes
came home.

7
00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:30.957
In Grovehaven, the lanterns rose all
night.

8
00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:38.705
And around the Hearth Oak, the eight great
voices sang together once more.

9
00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:41.600
So the Accord was kept.

11
00:00:47.643 --> 00:00:51.613
But the Wild is wide... and it is never
truly tame.

